      "Title": "AAMotion.AAValueArray<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.AAValueArray-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Base array wrapper - provides index validation, event triggering and other basic functionality\nUsed for low-level arrays (event-driven) that communicate with controller.\n<xref href=\"AAMotion.AAValueArray%601.Value\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> (on a single-valued parameter), the indexer and enumeration are controller round trips, so the debug\nview shows the slot's identity only.</p>\n"
    },
