      "Title": "AAMotion.ConnectionProbeFailure",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.ConnectionProbeFailure.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Why <xref href=\"AAMotion.MotionController.ProbeConnection(System.Nullable%7bSystem.Int32%7d)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> did not get a numeric reply.</p>\n"
