      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "AAMotion.FastReadCache",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.FastReadCache.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Fast read cache for high-performance data reading.\nA background thread refreshes the registered parameters every <xref href=\"AAMotion.FastReadCache.RefreshIntervalMs\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>,\nand a read of a registered parameter answers from the last refresh without a controller round\ntrip. Reads never take a lock, so callers polling a value from several threads never hold off\nthe refresh that writes it. A value that was never refreshed, that the controller answered\nwith an error, or that is not a number is a miss: the read goes to the controller instead.\nA refresh reads supported registrations in channel-sized batches, with motion status last.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.FastReadCache.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"11\">After a motion begins on an axis (<xref href=\"AAMotion.ISingleAxis.Begin\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, which every <code>MoveAbs</code>\nsends), a second thread reads that axis's <code>InTargetStat</code> every\n<xref href=\"AAMotion.AAMotionConfig.InTargetStatRefreshIntervalMs\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> until it reads 4. Until a reading\nshows the motion has started, the cache does not answer that axis's <code>MotionStat</code> or\n<code>InTargetStat</code> — those reads go to the controller — for at most\n<xref href=\"AAMotion.AAMotionConfig.MoveStartConfirmMs\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/AAMotion.HomingDefStep.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/AAMotion.HomingDefStep.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "AAMotion.HomingDefStep",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.HomingDefStep.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">One step of <xref href=\"AAMotion.ISingleAxis.HomingDef\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>. The array is 20 steps of 10 slots: slot 1\nholds the step type and slots 2-10 are that type's nine parameters, whose meaning depends on\nit — a speed, an acceleration, a position offset or a timeout in current-loop samples.</p>\n<p></p>\n<xref href=\"AAMotion.ISingleAxis.HomingDef\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> remains the escape hatch for a firmware step type this\nSDK does not name.\n"
    },
