      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "AAMotion.ICiGroupAxis",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.ICiGroupAxis.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">The Central-I group surface: <xref href=\"AAMotion.IGroupAxis\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> plus the CNCB parameters and the segment\nbuilders that push onto the second CNC buffer.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.ICiGroupAxis.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">Its CNC segment members take their arguments in controller counts on the same terms as\n<xref href=\"AAMotion.IGroupAxis\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> - push commands the Global User Units seam does not scale, so the whole-number <xref href=\"System.Int32\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> signatures are the contract rather than a missing retype.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/AAMotion.ICiIOModule.yml",
      "output": {
