      "Title": "AAMotion.OpticalCouplingLightFinding",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/AAMotion.OpticalCouplingLightFinding.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Optical coupling light-finding algorithm interface v3.0 (2026-07-09)\nLightweight workflow: 2 steps - parameter configuration, then start\nProcess types: spiral scan (ScanCode=1), single-axis scan (ScanCode=5)\nStatus queries: 602 (coupling result), 650 (error code), 736 (last sample index)</p>\n"
